{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a38876db-6b2e-8d4e-9e82-cc4729c8ae4e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T12:06:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maureen L. Kearney",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:03:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:03:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin. My name is Maureen Kearney. I'm calling about a downed tree, and I'm on my cell, so if I cut out, please tell me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:03:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, no problem. Go ahead, Maureen. Where's the tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:03:58-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 11 Marsh Street, in the Point. It came down sometime Saturday, I think early Saturday, during the end of the coastal storm. Actually, I noticed it Saturday morning around eight, so it may have gone down overnight Friday into Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:04:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Friday night into Saturday. Is it on your property or out on the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:04:19-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on the strip between the sidewalk and the street, right by my front walk. The whole root ball pulled up out of the ground. [line breaks up] and the sidewalk slab is tipped up on one side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:04:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up there. The root ball pulled up and the sidewalk is lifted. Is the tree blocking the road or the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:04:42-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's across the sidewalk, not the road. The trunk is resting against the fence of my neighbor, number nine. No wires that I can see, though I want to be exact, I can't see the top of it from my window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:04:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so no wires you can see. Writing that down. If you do see a wire down or sparking, stay clear and call the utility right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:05:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So my question is who handles this. Is it the city, is it me as the owner, or is it the utility company? I'm not sure whose tree it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:05:19-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, if it's in the city strip, it's a city street tree and we deal with it. If it's on private property, it's the owner's job. Utility only comes in if wires are involved. Since it's between the sidewalk and the street, sounds like it could be ours, but the tree crew would have to confirm that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:05:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. And to be clear, is this the right place to report it? Or is there a different number for trees?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:05:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're in the right place. I'll put in a request for the tree crew to look at it. Can I get a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:05:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0179."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:05:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven nine. Good. They're backed up after the storm, so it may take a few days to get someone out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:06:08-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I just wanted it on record. Sorry, one second, I have something on the stove. I'm trying a new chili recipe and I put in way too much cumin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:06:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little extra beans and tomatoes can help with that. Okay, Maureen, you're all set, request is in for 11 Marsh Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:06:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Kevin. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T12:06:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
